## Twistor action for SDYM

The SDYM action admits a twistor--space formulation of the form
$$S_{\mathrm{tw}} = \frac{1}{g_{\mathrm{tw}}^2}
\int_{\mathbb{PT}} \mathrm{Tr}\big(F^{(0,2)}\wedge \star F^{(0,2)}\big),$$
where:

